    "text": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. Lockpick is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
